/**
 * LegacyPort Anchor Exploder: finds the nearest anchor in reach (optionally only ones you placed),
 * charges it with glowstone and explodes it from Explode Slot, waiting for the enemy's damage tick if
 * asked. Silent Aim aims each step server-side.
 */
